          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Before there was a company, there was a living room. Anna began knitting for her first newborn, creating pieces she wished existed — clothes rooted in care, comfort, color, and handwork.<br/><br/>From those early moments came the Original Popcorn Sweater — today among our most beloved styles, appearing in a handful of silhouettes across Baby, Child, and Adult collections. Popcorn styles are loved for their handcrafted character, texture, and the way each wearer makes it their own. Hand-knit and often hand-dyed. Always familiar, thoughtfully scaled, and handcrafted by our incredible partners in Peru for 15 years, carrying the same memory and spirit. Handmade heirlooms: made with care, made to last.</p>",
